      "heading": "The checks that go in the record",
      "html": "<p>Flow and return temperatures at the design condition. Balancing across circuits. Flow rate and pump settings. Refrigerant checks. The electrical connection and protection. Controls: weather compensation, room and cylinder set points, hot water and legionella cycle. Antifreeze and water treatment in place.</p><p>Quickler asks for each as you work. Readings and photos are attached at the time. It records what you read from your instruments. Refrigerant work still needs F-Gas competence.</p>"
