      "html": "<h3>What is a heat pump commissioning checklist?</h3><p>The record made when a heat pump is commissioned. Design flow temperature, flow and return temperatures, balancing, refrigerant and electrical checks, controls, and photos. It goes in the handover pack with the MCS certificate.</p><h3>What is MCS 020?</h3><p>The MCS standard for the noise check on air source heat pumps. It shows the outdoor unit siting meets the noise limits. Check the current version.</p><h3>Must a heat pump install be MCS certified?</h3><p>Not for every install. But a Boiler Upgrade Scheme grant in England and Wales relies on one. Check the current MCS and BUS rules.</p><h3>Can I run commissioning in WhatsApp?</h3><p>Yes. You get each question in WhatsApp. Reply with a reading, a voice note or a photo. The handover report is written when you say done. No new app. No login.</p><h3>Related guides</h3><ul><li><a href=\"/pages/solar-pv-commissioning-report-uk.html\">Solar PV commissioning report</a></li><li><a href=\"/pages/ev-charger-installation-report-uk.html\">EV charger installation report</a></li><li><a href=\"/pages/battery-storage-inspection-report-uk.html\">Battery storage inspection report</a></li><li><a href=\"/pages/eicr-software-uk.html\">EICR and electrical reporting software</a></li></ul>"
